Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meet ArcTools, the trading terminal for Arc,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Circle's USDC native chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:07.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,The terminal puts every launchpad in one table,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:10.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,new pairs, trending, insider picks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Set a quick buy amount once and fire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,with one click, signed by a trading wallet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:15.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,that never leaves your browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every token page has a live chart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:21.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,trades, holders, and one swap that routes across Uniswap,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:24.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,V3, V4, bonding curves and Warp, always the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:24.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:27.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Insiders ranks the top 100 wallets by 30
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:29.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,-day profit and streams their moves to Telegram.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:32.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,Intel shows whales, fresh capital, bridge flows, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,lets you build your own alert rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:36.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,The feed lists every launch from 10 venues,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,seconds after deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:39.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Launch your own token on ArcToolsPad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,stake ARCT to earn from every trade and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:44.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,bridge USDC in with Circle CCTP, and when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,away, the Telegram sniper fires for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:49.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,ArcTools.fun — trade the whole chain.
